1
00:00:00,957 --> 00:00:02,457
Isn’t anyone gonna ask?

2
00:00:02,625 --> 00:00:05,965
-You're gonna have sex with Penny.
-That's not what I was gonna tell you.

3
00:00:06,129 --> 00:00:08,669
(Raj:)It's okay. I don't mind hearing
about your sex life.

4
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:10,670
(Raj:)It's his that bugs me.

5
00:00:12,927 --> 00:00:15,427
(Leonard:)Guess who the university
is sending to Switzerland...

6
00:00:15,596 --> 00:00:19,726
(Leonard:)...to attend a conference and see the
CERN Super Collider on February 14th?

7
00:00:19,892 --> 00:00:21,602
Professor Norton. God knows why.

8
00:00:21,769 --> 00:00:25,309
(Sheldon:)He hasn't published anything of note
since he won that Nobel Prize.

9
00:00:25,481 --> 00:00:28,481
(Leonard:)Professor Norton can't make it.
He threw his back out climbing.

10
00:00:28,651 --> 00:00:31,361
(Howard:)I heard he threw his back out
climbing on his girlfriend.

11
00:00:31,529 --> 00:00:33,819
-Weather girl on Channel Two?
-That's the one.

12
00:00:33,990 --> 00:00:37,450
(Leonard:)In any case,
they're asking me to fill in for him.

13
00:00:37,618 --> 00:00:40,328
(Sheldon:)In Switzerland
or with the big-boobed weather girl?

14
00:00:40,913 --> 00:00:44,123
(Leonard:)Switzerland.
And I get to bring a guest.

15
00:00:44,292 --> 00:00:47,462
RAJESH: Oh, no way, dude!
-Oh, my God, this is incredible.

16
00:00:47,628 --> 00:00:50,668
I'm so happy I'm not gonna question
their judgment in picking you.

17
00:00:51,591 --> 00:00:54,431
I'm just gonna run home
and start packing.

18
00:00:56,888 --> 00:00:59,098
Wait, why wouldn't you take Penny?

19
00:01:00,349 --> 00:01:02,769
(Leonard:)I am taking Penny.

20
00:01:02,935 --> 00:01:04,765
(Leonard:)Oh.

21
00:01:04,937 --> 00:01:10,027
(Raj:)Then I anticipate an awkward situation
when you get home.

